<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Co upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Co upgraded to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it upgraded Sun Co Inc to buy from neutral and set a 12-month price target on the stock of $31-$35.</p>
<p>-- sees Sun Co as a potential takeover target.</p>
<p>-- sees latest restructuring moving ahead in right direction, expects Sun to revamp certain marketing operations.</p>
<p>-- Sun was up 3/8 to 25-1/2 in late morning trading.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
